WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,560 --> 00:00:07,560
Come and have a drink at my place?

2
00:00:09,490 --> 00:00:10,530
You're not afraid of me poisoning you

3
00:00:11,710 --> 00:00:13,910
If you want to touch me, you don’t need to poison me.

4
00:00:14,310 --> 00:00:15,310
One shot will destroy it

5
00:00:15,550 --> 00:00:17,510
Just on this basis, I want to make an attack

6
00:00:17,510 --> 00:00:19,230
Once destroyed, you don’t even have the strength to fight back.

7
00:00:19,230 --> 00:00:20,270
Good thing

8
00:00:20,270 --> 00:00:21,550
I'll accompany you with a hundred pounds of rice

9
00:00:21,550 --> 00:00:23,740
Ten boxes of instant noodles are no longer needed.

10
00:00:24,220 --> 00:00:25,540
As long as you can leave tomorrow

11
00:00:25,940 --> 00:00:27,900
Shan'an at your base can agree?

12
00:00:28,180 --> 00:00:31,420
Who is that Shan'an? It's nothing like this if you can't suppress it.

13
00:00:31,420 --> 00:00:32,620
Tell me a little bit about you

14
00:00:32,620 --> 00:00:33,700
I'll tell you a little bit about mine

15
00:00:35,060 --> 00:00:36,540
I am the chairman of Xinglong Shopping Mall

16
00:00:37,580 --> 00:00:39,900
Shan'anjia is Xinglong's largest cooperative workshop

17
00:00:39,900 --> 00:00:40,860
We are family friends

18
00:00:41,300 --> 00:00:42,740
Something happened to my family before Mo Shi

19
00:00:42,740 --> 00:00:43,860
Something happened to both parents

20
00:00:43,860 --> 00:00:47,020
As soon as I, Lin Wei, took over Xinglong and got on the right track, Mo Shi broke out.
